{
  "slug": "mulmocast",
  "name": "Mulmocast",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MulmoCast skills for Claude Code — create, narrate, and extend video presentations from any input",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `conversation-chat` (Create a conversation practice chat MulmoScript with speech bubble UI and character illustration (voiceover approach)), `explainer-shorts` (Create \"What is ___?\" explainer YouTube Shorts — 3-beat structure with visual breakdown (15-25 seconds)), `extend` (Add metadata to an existing MulmoScript to create an ExtendedMulmoScript), `fact-shorts` (Create \"Did you know?\" YouTube Shorts — 2-beat loop structure with counter animation (12-18 seconds)), `illustrate` (Create MulmoScript with AI-generated illustrations through structured creative process), `mulmocast` (Unified entry point — automatically routes input to the appropriate MulmoCast skill), `narrate` (Convert source files (PDF, PPTX, Markdown, Keynote) into narrated ExtendedMulmoScript), `news-shorts` (Create YouTube Shorts news video — article to published Shorts in one flow), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mulmocast@claude-community` from `receptron/mulmocast-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
